{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "35825b90-9496-874c-8e3a-d3eca76bb4ba",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:56:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:52:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. [pause] I'm calling about trash. Somebody keeps dumping bags at the corner by my place, and I'm done dealing with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:52:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's aggravating. Let me get some details. Where is the corner you're talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 149 Annandale Road. North End. The bags get piled right at the corner there, next to the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:52:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 149 Annandale Road, in the North End, at the corner by the utility pole. Is it bags of regular household trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:52:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Black bags, some white ones. Maybe six or seven this time. It's the neighbor, I'm pretty sure. I've seen him walk them over there, as I said before, he does it at night, or early, whatever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:53:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you said before? Have you called us about this already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:53:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I mean I said it to my wife. Never mind. [sighs] It's just a habit. Anyway, it's been going on a few weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:53:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So a few weeks, bags piling up at that corner, and you believe it's a neighbor. Did you see which house, or is it more that you suspect?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I saw him. Two houses down. But I'm not trying to start a war, I just want the stuff gone and him to stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. I'll put in a request so a crew can look at the corner and pick up what's there. Do you want me to leave the neighbor's address out of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, leave it out. Just the corner. Is there a fee for this? Because I'm not paying for somebody else's garbage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you wouldn't be charged for reporting it or for the crew checking it out. You're not the one dumping, so there's no bill coming to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. That was my worry, honestly. I figured it'd be one of those things where I get stuck with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all. Now, can I confirm a callback number in case we need to reach you about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0186. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Julio Morales."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Morales. Is that M-O-R-A-L-E-S?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:54:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I have Julio Morales, 149 Annandale Road, a pile of six or seven bags at the corner by the pole, dumped over a few weeks. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Though it's more every few days. It builds up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:55:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, I'll note that it keeps getting added to. If it's still piling up after the crew clears it, call us back and we can have someone look into the repeat dumping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. How long is it gonna take, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:55:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually within a few working days for a pickup like this. Could be sooner if the route allows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:55:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days. [sighs] Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know it's a hassle. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Honestly, I like talking to a real person for once. Every other place I call, it's a menu and a recording."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:56:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you got me. We still answer the phones here. Take care, Mr. Morales."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
